t. Immediately afterward run one synthetic public-repository prompt and\nrecord provider, model, latency, retry metadata, and observable usage.\n\n## Wise Broker pass and next step\n\nThe adjacent high-value opportunity is the already-tested conservative router:\nit increases useful local work without human per-request routing. The\nsimplest next step is to add the approved short-lived external capability to\nthat same boundary and run one low-sensitivity comparison; this increases\ncompute without increasing routing burden.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-09-11T17:28:01Z","updated_at":"2026-09-11T17:28:01Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"6168b0565958458a90ec69d0ee3a1c93c2d5cb11","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"pashamango:agent/wolfram/SOVEREIGN-WORKER-RUNWAY-0002","ref":"agent/wolfram/SOVEREIGN-WORKER-RUNWAY-0002","repo":{"id":1257706201,"node_id":"R_kgDOSvcS2Q","name":"minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab","full_name":"pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab","owner":{"login":"pashamango","id":141678664,"node_id":"U_kgDOCHHYSA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141678664?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango","html_url":"https://github.com/pashamango","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/received_events","type":"User